      "sourceTextSha256": "a175abbbee9f3d8a7e4696f8cf59cfacfd12c8d036a56cce20b2b04b62479a44",
      "text": "Breakfast, then a city tour of Lima: the Parque del Amor in Miraflores, overlooking the Pacific; the adobe pyramid of Huaca Huallamarca; the Plaza Mayor with the Government Palace and City Hall; the Cathedral (or the MALI art museum if closed); the Santo Domingo Monastery, where Saint Martín de Porres and Saint Rose of Lima rest; and the Larco Museum, an 18th-century mansion built on a pre-Columbian pyramid, with its remarkable collection of ancient Peruvian art. Transfer to the airport for your flight home.",
